員一個人在上班而已，其他有兩位應該是在休息吃飯，中途吃到一半有看到，我只覺得這個店員真的是挺可憐的，一個人身兼全部職，不知道薪水有沒有領多份職位的薪水，這不是能不能做到的問題，而是這件事情本身就是非常不合理的事情，我也只能說有些成本就是老闆自己得要去吸收的，而不是靠壓榨員工去節省成本。\n\n我那天就看這個店員在煮我的拉麵，麵煮好拉起來的時候剛好有一個客人要結帳，結果我煮好的麵就被拉起來掛在那裡，等到結完帳才繼續出我的麵，這樣就導致我吃的麵已經太軟又有部分已經結塊，但是我不怪那個員工，我怪的是貴司在安排人力上怎麼會做出如此糟糕的決定。\n\n靠著壓榨員工為公司節省成本，結果最後導致出餐品質整個嚴重下滑，我想老闆可能自己做決定前還是要想想。",null,[0,206]]]],[null,1753077720000000,1753077720000000,"1 年前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfcEVNeVphY0wtS2FEM3k5Y2dlTTU1dw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiLwoZQ0hfcEVNeVphY0wtS2FEM3k5Y2dlTTU1dxoSQ2dzSTJLXzN3d1lRdU11M1hB\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiS2t-28tSWAxU2kq8BHd9JE2QQ_2MIsgIoCA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14193162937581622681/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxZUZKVlJsbFJWemxEVVdwb1dGbHRhRlZqYld0NFYyNVZlRmxZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14193162937581622681/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxZUZKVlJsbFJWemxEVVdwb1dGbHRhRlZqYld0NFYyNVZlRmxZWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14193162937581622681/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxZUZKVlJsbFJWemxEVVdwb1dGbHRhRlZqYld0NFYyNVZlRmxZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14193162937581622681/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxZUZKVlJsbFJWemxEVVdwb1dGbHRhRlZqYld0NFYyNVZlRmxZWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14193162937581622681/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxZUZKVlJsbFJWemxEVVdwb1dGbHRhRlZqYld0NFYyNVZlRmxZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14193162937581622681/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxZUZKVlJsbFJWemxEVVdwb1dGbHRhRlZqYld0NFYyNVZlRmxZWXhBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["親愛的顧客您好，\n感謝您蒞臨一風堂中山店，也謝謝您詳細紀錄當天的用餐過程。\n很抱歉當天未在第一時間提供您餐點，以致於餐點品質不如您的預期。\n確實如您所提，當日現場人力安排有所不足，造成同仁需同時負責多項工作。未來我們會努力加強人力排班與現場支援的彈性安排，避免再次發生類似情況。非常感謝您對現場人員的體諒，也謝謝您對公司制度安排的建議，期待未來有機會再次為您提供更好的用餐體驗。\n祝日安\n台灣一風堂敬上 J",null,[0,69]]]],[null,null,8185,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201eFJVRllRVzlDUWpoWFltaFVjbWt4V25VeFlYYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x4e536d4a45a0cbf!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOm5xRUFYQW9CQjhXYmhUcmkxWnUxYXc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201eFJVRllRVzlDUWpoWFltaFVjbWt4V25VeFlYYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201eFJVRllRVzlDUWpoWFltaFVjbWt4V25VeFlYYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201eFJVRllRVzlDUWpoWFltaFVjbWt4V25VeFlYYxILMGNVUFNoNDlKNDQaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09tNXhSVUZZUVc5Q1FqaFhZbWhVY21reFduVXhZWGMSCzBjVVBTaDQ5SjQ0IhIJAAAAAAAAAAARvwxapNQ25QQqCzBjVVBTaDQ5SjQ0\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiS2t-28tSWAxU2kq8BHd9JE2QQoykIswIoCQ"],null,[null,[[1,1]]]],"0ahUKEwjJmee28tSWAxUOkMAFHXnEEBIQ0pMFCNoBKAc"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwiS2t-28tSWAxU2kq8BHd9JE2QQ0pMFCKUCKAc"]],null,null,null,"other_user_google_review_posts__and__hotel_and_vr_partner_review_posts",null,"CjEIARIpCgoAP7_LAJ4a____EhAVWYfrU7poLyA_bd4AAAAAGgn92QcCZ9Up_eEYACIA"]],null,null,null,[3,1,null,null,null,[2]],["顧客表示這家拉麵店的美味拉麵深受喜愛，尤其是辣味噌和豚骨湯頭。他們也喜歡多種小菜，像是煎餃和章魚小丸子。親切又細心的店員、乾淨的洗手間和合理的價格亦受到好評。\n\n部分評論提到，服務效率有時候可能不太理想。",null,"https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5%401:CAIQACodChtyc19oOlpWMjZzaEcyQmhDWkl6R3duaTJQVGc%7CCAIQACorChtyc19oOlpWMjZzaEcyQmhDWkl6R3duaTJQVGcSDAiTlMLRBhCs1qSbAQ\u0026d\u003d286732321\u0026t\u003d8",72,null,[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKGiTXDuyggQdDmR6s-SFew1PlfX7T-XU1ZtUIE6IQo26LZzLbx\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"],["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocImZNggAzC0p9PIW58GDp72Y_m0aP7XWQkgiBip6S_OkgWQsA\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"],["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVrPETn3XZKXFi_iGV2zts3zj5fMlkKxtchqftT0ESlLsNAQOw\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"]]]],null,null,[["02 2562 9222",[["02 2562 9222",1],["